# URAM_URAM_FT (four URAM288 sites): a tile type the reference never fuzzed; its window
# is in tilegrid.windows. Generated by designs/kv260_uram_char/emit_uram.py
# from that directory's random specimens (12 URAM288s each, every attribute,
# every control-pin tie and data-bus tie random, no cascades), fitted
# together with the other URAM tile type: both share this layout. With these
# features every tile instance of every specimen is predicted exactly. See
# emit_uram.py's docstring for each feature (ZSELF_MASK is the mask
# inverted; IS_<pin>_INVERTED is the inversion in effect, a tied pin being
# fed VCC). Regenerate:
#   emit_uram.py build --emit x && (cat header; sed 's/^URAM\./URAM_URAM_FT./' x) > this file
